<title>CYPRUS: SOCCER-RESULTS OF CYPRIOT SOCCER MATCHES OF WEEKEND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF CYPRIOT SOCCER MATCHES OF WEEKEND.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the first week of the Cyprus soccer league at the weekend:</p>
<p>    Anorthosis    4	 Olympiakos  0</p>
<p>    APOEL	   5	 APOP	  4</p>
<p>    Alki	    0	 AEK	   2</p>
<p>    Paralimni     1	 Apollon     0</p>
<p>    Ethnikos	1	 APEP	  0</p>
<p>    Aris	    3	 Anagenisis  1</p>
<p>The Omonia v Salamina match in Nicosia was abandoned after a pitch invasion with Omonia leading 3-2.</p>
</text>
